class A:
    def xxx(self):
        return "A"

class B(A):
    def xxx(self):
        return "B"

class C(A):
    def xxx(self):
        return "C"

def proses(obj):
    return obj.xxx()

data = [A(), B(), C()]

for item in data:
    print(proses(item))

Program tersebut menerapkan konsep polymorphism.

